.TH AGENT-HOOK-PRE-SEARCH 1 "2026-09-09" "agentguard" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agent-hook-pre-search \- dispatch file-search guards before execution
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent-hook-pre-search
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agent-hook-pre-search
reads a PreToolUse hook JSON payload from standard input. The base hook
enforces nothing itself: file-search tools differ per agent, so
agent-specific extensions
.RB ( agent-hook-pre-search\- <agent>)
carry the policy. Fail-open throughout: an uninspectable payload never
blocks the tool call.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The search call is allowed, possibly with warnings.
.TP
.B 2
An extension blocked the search call.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR agent-hook-pre-search-muse (1)
